</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To know Thy loving heart!</l><l>To cleave to Thy blest side!</l><l>To gaze upon Thee where Thou art,</l><l>And in Thy love abide!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To walk with Thee below!</l><l>To learn Thy holy ways!</l><l>And more to Thine own stature grow,</l><l>To Thine eternal praise!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thyself our one Desire!</l><l>Thyself our Object here!</l><l>The goal to which our hearts aspire—</l><l>To meet Thee in the air!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
